  "title": "Comparing P300 Flashing paradigms in online typing with language models",
  "description": "EEG recordings from a P300 speller brain-computer interface study comparing flashing paradigms for online typing with language model support. The dataset was collected with BCI2000 to evaluate typing performance across different stimulus presentation schemes. It supports research on P300-based communication interfaces.",
  "methods_description": "Data were recorded using the BCI2000 platform during online P300 speller typing sessions with multiple flashing paradigms and language model integration. Subject 5 did not complete all three flashing paradigms in the testing stage and was excluded from the analysis.",
